        "Written against: vue 3.5.24, 12 delivered packages.",
        "  Other delivered libraries: 70, axios 1.13.2, @nextcloud/logger 3.0.3, util 0.12.5, vite-plugin-node-polyfills 0.24.0, date-fns 4.1.0, sax 1.4.3, and 64 more.",
